{"baseRefName":"main","body":"## 변경\n- 차트뷰 일반 홈은 변경하지 않음. 수출 전체 요약에 10일 잠정치 요약을 맨 위에 배치.\n- 품목별 YoY/MoM 표와 영업일 보정 OFF/ON, 새로고침.\n- 기준기간·원자료/보정 라벨, 부족한 자료의 계산 금지, 데이터 제공범위 공개.\n- 데이터 정규화 및 E2E/단위 회귀 테스트.\n\n## 선행 필요\nbackend chart_View PR의 businessDays 배포 시 옵션 활성화. API가 제공하지 않는 10일 DRAM/NAND/SSD 등은 가짜 값으로 채우지 않습니다.\n\n## 검증\nPR의 regression/mobile release QA가 통과해야 main 반영 가능합니다.","files":[{"path":"docs/decision-log.md","additions":7,"deletions":0},{"path":"src/exportMomentum.css","additions":40,"deletions":0},{"path":"src/exportMomentumModel.js","additions":17,"deletions":0},{"path":"src/exportMomentumView.js","additions":25,"deletions":3},{"path":"src/exportProvisionalDigest.js","additions":81,"deletions":0},{"path":"tests/e2e/exports.spec.mjs","additions":28,"deletions":0},{"path":"tests/export_momentum.test.mjs","additions":19,"deletions":0},{"path":"tests/export_provisional_digest.test.mjs","additions":49,"deletions":0},{"path":"tests/export_tabs.test.mjs","additions":1,"deletions":1},{"path":"tests/mobile_release_qa.mjs","additions":2,"deletions":0}],"headRefName":"feat/export-provisional-workdays-20261011","headRefOid":"d57e7f4fed8ca758079678279dfb51765e89bd42","number":127,"state":"OPEN","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-11T02:11:23Z","conclusion":"FAILURE","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/shoon94parkk-del/chart-view-toss/actions/runs/38104294738/job/114366390289","name":"api-smoke","startedAt":"2026-10-11T02:11:16Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Live backend contract smoke"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-11T02:15:14Z","conclusion":"FAILURE","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/shoon94parkk-del/chart-view-toss/actions/runs/38104294698/job/114366390022","name":"chromium-mobile","startedAt":"2026-10-11T02:10:46Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Mobile release QA"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-11T02:11:56Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/shoon94parkk-del/chart-